<div class="ui icon info message">
    <i class="info circle icon"></i>
    <div class="content">
        <div class="header">
            How widget configurations work
        </div>
        <p>
            When a user visits your store, this plugin will query the database to see if there is a matching pair with
            the channel (i.e. <strong>{{ sylius.channel.name }}</strong>) and the locale (i.e. <strong>{{ sylius.localeCode }}</strong>).
        </p>
        <p>
            If there is a match, the widget configuration for that pair will be used to display the texts etc. in the consent widget.
            If there's no match, a pair will be created with the given channel and locale and the default configuration will be used.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
